     "question": "My baby girl was born under Rohini, second quarter. Which letter should the name start with, and can you suggest names?",
     "text": "For **Rohini’s second quarter**, the traditional starting letter is **ව** (“Va”); **ච** (“Cha”) is also used as an alternative in the site’s list. The letter guidance is marked provisional, so families may follow a different tradition.\n\nSome girl-name suggestions from the list:\n\n- **Vajira** (වජිරා) — diamond  \n- **Wasanthi** (වසන්ති) — of the spring  \n- **Chandima** (චන්දිමා) — moonlight  \n- **Chandrani** (චන්ද්‍රානි) — like the moon  \n- **Chandrika** (චන්ද්‍රිකා) — moonlight  \n- **Chathurika** (චතුරිකා) — clever  \n\nChoose the sound and spelling that feel right for your family; the birth-star letter is a custom, not a requirement.",
